Keep a shared answers as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared gap as 0.
Set gap to 7.
To extend from value (a whole number) with depth (a whole number).
If depth is 0, Place value into answers, return.
The lastdigit is value modulo 10.
The down is lastdigit minus gap.
The up is lastdigit plus gap.
If down is at least 0, Extend from value times 10 plus down with depth minus 1.
If up is at most 9 and up is not down, Extend from value times 10 plus up with depth minus 1.

For every first from 1 to 9.
Extend from first with 2.

Sort answers.
